  - actorId: chichiko
    displayName: Chichiko Beridze
    bio: 'Hair Salon Owner. Vain, compulsive, and oddly endearing. Chichiko runs the neighbourhood hair salon and considers himself the foremost authority on aesthetic self-improvement in the district. He performs his own botox, mixes his own serums, and treats every border crossing as a fresh opportunity to dispense unsolicit... Alter ego: The Mutated Looksmaxer.'
