  - actorId: miriam
    displayName: Mariam Beridze "Miri"
    bio: "Student. A typical teen girl with a harsh attitude. Studies hard to become a doctor. Has a mom, dad, and a sister; Sharena is her mom. She tries hard to gain her teacher and mom's love \u2014 an overachiever raised under a harsh mother. Has a special interest in human anatomy. Alter ego: The Anatomist."
