  - actorId: petre
    displayName: Petre Dolidze "The Poet"
    bio: 'Priest / Writer. A hermit priest who lives alone in the mountains. Says very little and means most of it. Keeps a dog. Used to keep a wife. Has written several volumes of poetry that no one outside the mountain parishes has read. Considers this correct. Alter ego: The Word.'
