    displayName: Tina Meskhi
    bio: Accountant. Controlled, seductive, and carefully evasive. She wears a porcelain mask at all times, claiming it covers old scars -- though she volunteers this explanation so readily it feels rehearsed. An accountant with no recorded family and no traceable past. She deploys warmth and charm deliberately, and if...
