    description: 'Main.unity ''---ENV_Booth'' (auto-described; edit freely). Openings: booth_rollingshutter, booth_window_pane, booth_purchase_glass, booth_door_2. Props/details: booth_x_ray_machine, booth_stamps, booth_table_bell_2, booth_notice_board, booth_telephone, booth_quarantine_board, booth_pc, booth_tv, booth_security_camera, booth_drawer_folders, booth_calendar, booth_lever. Story marks: booth_stand_pos, booth_look_pos, booth_ocho_reappear_point, booth_not_seated_pos, booth_table_bell, booth_chair, booth_door, booth_player_pos_follow, booth_climb_through_target_pos, booth_seat_pos, booth_seat_pos_2, booth_purchase_radio_stand, booth_vlad_front_of_gate_pos, booth_vlad_front_of_gate_pos_2, booth_vlad_front_of_door_pos, booth_vlad_in_booth_pos, booth_vlad_in_booth_pos_2, booth_in_front_of_gate_pos, booth_alexei_land_pos, booth_vlad_waypoint_booth_door, booth_guard_start_pos. Read each mark''s context for what surrounds it.'
    marks:
    - markId: booth_stand_pos
      description: at 'Stand pos'
      context: 'indoors (ceiling 4.0m); ahead: 0.6m to booth_drawer_folders; open space L 0.8m, R 6.7m, behind 5.0m; near: booth_quarantine_board 0.7m left at 2.6m high, booth_drawer_folders 1.1m ahead at 1.6m high, booth_pc 1.2m ahead at 2.0m high, booth_atm 1.4m behind-left at 2.0m high, booth_fan 1.9m ahead-right at 3.6m high; marks: booth_vlad_in_booth_pos 2.2m behind-right (seen through glass), booth_chair 2.3m behind-left (no line of sight), booth_climb_through_target_pos 2.4m right (seen through glass)'
      position: {x: -1.2724075, y: 0.0032300055, z: -12.482914}
