      context: 'NOT A FLOOR SPOT (2.4m above the floor): use only as a face/look target, never as a start/move mark; indoors (ceiling 1.6m); ahead: 0.6m to a wall/obstacle; open space L 0.8m, R 6.6m, behind 6.0m; near: booth_pc 0.1m right at -0.4m high, booth_drawer_folders 0.3m behind-right at -0.8m high, booth_calendar 0.8m ahead-right at 0.0m high, booth_fan 1.2m right at 1.2m high, booth_ashtray 1.2m right at -1.1m high; marks: booth_table_bell 2.5m right (no line of sight), booth_stand_pos 2.7m behind (in view), booth_in_front_of_gate_pos 3.4m ahead (no line of sight)'
